2026-11-07T06:35:58.6503610Z 
2026-11-07T06:35:58.6504610Z I will:
2026-11-07T06:35:58.6504750Z 
2026-11-07T06:35:58.6505350Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T06:35:58.6505810Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T06:35:58.6506160Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T06:35:58.6506490Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T06:35:58.6506710Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T06:35:58.6506960Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T06:35:58.6507370Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T06:35:58.6507700Z    /var/root
2026-11-07T06:35:58.6535060Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T06:35:58.6535600Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T06:35:58.6569730Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T06:35:58.6570140Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T06:35:58.6571090Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-11-07T06:35:58.6571590Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
